; line-height: 30px; font-weight: 700; padding-top: 12px; border-top: 1px solid; margin-top: 40px;"&gt;全球必读&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt;&lt;strong style="font-size: 16px;"&gt;特朗普驳斥了&lt;/strong&gt;有关伊朗战争正在&lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/jfKmlFaXT0urB1vMUjY9mjDKInlDKWgfmbLEALL9kFp_PHlI4BnAGznY_3CkWw3XlbGASrqUgqFuCiFye4-RthsIHt9l8rT6MQc8zYIG0xHDp8Kgb79AVHX_q2ebKriH8LppabTYhyXRkmfznjTYKGDOeTyXn61Kw2RSerVvinbiW335jwWd49iaCDQR0ZyatCGs5jPuJehl_Hbsv9IqbQ2eL8DG8T4BJf0f9jsBAk2HtyiXCwd73m4YLDyq7AJrlhw6JEv8LcwGU0ivKS-CDnVYdZn8W1Dky3URnCGgYLTjKzEDkdE750zSXh0VN_3Ozlg4vCb-lAzvdxVyzyLcdpFIrpaPUi9G1btgWQg5jSgQCw8OvwBcSAygKARFGo_f8sTwW0jWIjkwzdyjbYLH3IpoJhCID-4aTVuphveFhAws_L7tkfiVmDKjUMGA1rIgpclH6fRwgwpTS64yt437eCQP0cDXtrodL5rX-z1ZzHac3kD8cpI_750H82asFIdS9FuBO4V9je2QukXNElX35ojDXECkQW0y0EVs9X1L/5rJ53XxRpoLYzrYhRbUeGtQUzDTA8ceL/24" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="font-size: inherit; color: #00e;" target="_blank" title="中东冲突重启，特朗普驳斥与伊朗的“小规模战争”"&gt;耗尽美国火力的&lt;/a&gt;担忧，因为持续了六个多月的时断时续的敌对行动再次爆发冲突，双方都不愿意重启谈判。 “这对我们来说是一场相对较小的战争，”他对记者表示，并无视对美国弹药短缺的批评，称军方拥有“无限量的中级和较旧”库存。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt;&lt;strong style="font-size: 16px;"&gt;至少 955 人死亡&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong style="font-size: 16px;"&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;冰川崩塌在边境地区引发洪水和废墟，尼泊尔和中国仍有 4,471 人失踪，而救援队正在努力抵达偏远社区。作为亚洲最贫穷的经济体之一，尼泊尔面临着&lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/AX01bHa-4zb2QEB1yWnVhNuAKU0Y2TtUPipmdyoOUglrihDhyfrKwaF4vSTDyLJBaLaCg5BUdFtebm9eJSZXDeerG-Fe4kVIwbIJaLvUKh0JpyWI7nJKY8gBQwD4oofk4dcd71FKFScpxkooPW77WpHuTjL4Pp2E3lrjVau0RhZNQ42FJCednA45umi3d52TtmswdhELPd8IkL12M2etGvnuy5BHBghl_46TpGd49vJGsmqvZQCOROpL4kofFWGquS1UAWdDuBvRW8LfC0FmkHi4gmgaORNxfINGXuiixjBB3k1fgQ_3vPlsjro0Eq9o3smK5MHcIDtfeafdARxHRlDENmkop0_4BfyxwLpLB0jfyfE93FnmywMwnjGsyGOoYAtIKmYECbfrNIGwDZq8uhI0N2Im-yCwVLFGMaKyi1g4PDY6y3qXDkR_ALuiBpexwigtRssgRZKq4_TwztCtZzKglBBQF6vIzteECxUSx9zVE5r8NrbKl6XiIYzSiW0_nAWcTgeDi4c-06pc-OT504an9xqtHKA20d0ss2Ri/6NbgN6YyMBXD4LFY-xPTLTwHwP