er" style="font-size: inherit; color: #00e;" target="_blank" title="连续热浪过后，伦敦人发现家中出现“可怕”的裂缝"&gt;房屋&lt;/a&gt;沉降相关的保险索赔创下了纪录。公用事业公司竭尽全力避免重演&lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/s/c/FbbkLmemiORy2f3_hNVsjsjpbdurZ7-3w-1sXJxqtC0cAJvYshPzQwCEys73n1VcsP1WRvainPT7k7CeT63j8wRsI6np61oNYY5TP1BMbk7J1uUBQste3lOwFprFIusQMdqpJ9rUZxLZ6wincGG-mW32LBLKOUJmUvbbKtCcIMSBf2_HxY7tsspcRpIt5olp7D-fiU-cDJT3zDZTduHf6fyLwAkc2H1EPlZrrkVJGZpStTBpNlt5eR1tWFxUupz0dmtOvSBV9o9T4nd5ayf3xiEcAooVfZ3DiGxuzr4jeV1ywTMr75-0Vbv3357nDvyQ7lEACVBX25K-QnYjNWqLYSLw_w/BSqLOm3eA9sdHUSldAM1IA6jU0PXB-sA/24" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="font-size: inherit; color: #00e;" target="_blank" title="立管干旱 - 1975 年至 1976 年"&gt;1976年的危机&lt;/a&gt;，当时一些地区实行定量供水，人们从街上的立管里装水。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt;英国生态与水文中心水资源和干旱负责人&lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/s/c/2euXRhLMGOyDjjv1h83z_5BI9PIoIZFdQaXxAEyeWzn6eG2VKxAnJ0s_XO27CSzRFgI7Hy9RlYsnDmoOxbUMEC-S443eOAxEt2Lc5frHhDZ-3uAUOlvq7iYMKbtUDaq_kXz2IeeYzhUmcyhtM9Un9bVXJHPhcBw62I62mGpCJNCXLRydopIAA1MCGp2P74b2zS5_vxqrlc3GgGbUVeHU8QSo3liYntfJ3s7EmeykOXXpdBJPfiuCb-F_DfLphD7K_RNlwryAxkj4PPjEqrKDRJt3RR868pqelDmSQiRTH8hJWjJMJAkn0w/EXwmqWgOkHpkZ3qXvSwvBJfAtcSOYdpn/24" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="font-size: inherit; color: #00e;" target="_blank" title="杰米·汉纳福德先生 |英国生态与水文学中心"&gt;杰米·汉纳福德 (Jamie Hannaford)&lt;/a&gt;表示：“2026 年夏季出现了我们所见过的最严重的突发干旱。”&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt;自来水公司现在正在为情况进一步恶化的可能性做好准备。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt;周二举行了一场听证会， &lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/s/c/lXK-_eQzAgIB0AE3tItCuCVnpypTsnIofjkjOqB0-oeXL3Mjz___xsGIJE5U42Z6apEoBYZhOQNbzWHCXIo4pOlxtnZDqyhumU2VtHPrPppxTjxaI_1EDl42Ff87KPAt7wThWIblNpF8o4oB1iFgzPn86DDvUwsEn7Zza4_NTykVys6Ia6k7WtNH3A2A3EedtmXUGlCxCsGBWq49aZxbM6Onm9B8tYLfPGEH3gIFCP1NWbeKr7NL8TwXW3ZH14rkN8IMrfxJl9M7oxvPXmbQfwr3Qj3VrvcSezYhQuw/A5yTpr4qZuurGtfPFpDUODDE2Y4Ocyd8/24" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="font-size: inherit; color