约一个月来首次交锋&lt;/strong&gt;，美国军队袭击了伊朗的火箭发射器，伊朗伊斯兰共和国则向约旦&lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/ObCEM9IK7cPDEgJh2_OJgeGaQWv_N7_gDmrKrkv-dhfsJVTrvEvzPYf3e9pru_T63MLgAUIgJulGLHMiOMxf5y2d8dFMQ0R0BvIyPRvr0tduHEQ394KRz8LjIcrZ4WcvJVoUO9X37WZAnOwjMplMcpZ7hgwajVcaV5l0zczzWeugYTHQqNt4ak4npWq4kxAHsqqSxetzekDf0oBADsMtZbpGmlZ5Lly6tT_HtUzQjT8PIf9pjEmcVxvLEFXRWK5m2UFq0jxAEakwKeLgSHeKCZ1R8Ur6j6WYjZNusJNpo-YdVOPfz2k9zebX-4MgQcDKgvgvUw0AtAhmBmAh8OWj5M9IxHjKmnbV3eL1usyaEmzrGnGIaIwLLD_L_nlYMAFEhGfwOLRfUTYq3dTiV8yM69Sg5kTfbdSxK8ItC98UHYufIntnQI3174P7mz5UL8ztLH0jJLz6u63jyWNlREADheDqVrdMc7GwuKE3CpSJDFKS5LFx_4g6Bw6PZszJusItaKsNMbL7xyjQ8y_z-aBTI-k-8Bi-7ysvp1jSpTdQ/izRR0qEfWpD0UqqXsWBH1PB1IRdjFvkm/24" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="font-size: inherit; color: #00e;" target="_blank" title="美国和伊朗约一个月来首次相互攻击"&gt;发射导弹&lt;/a&gt;作为回应。在美国财政部长斯科特·贝森特发誓要对伊朗及其贸易伙伴进行“经济攻击”之后，与德黑兰有联系的国家迄今为止都没有理会这一威胁，分析人士对美国的行动&lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/4BLiNNApS_amt6akskH8k0HAEJeZGvBLo1v8tgrn1j-2tiJjmWv8eweYwV0O4KxGz94s9zyBJBmgrsV7gsEuMSKvuJNYLbNmkayuqmXCYEgUb6HheFrGBewQVrdCUJZ6MHuvKDa3UAFqIr3CoGS5RydWzPVf-E69MofqvQJatsonGz3PESnll9el7pZ9d1x2BGAP5o9bRPihfElk5IQLY5i0t7SWXUISqXgnNF37tgaT01fM0io8GC5gbQ9TtMTtNwGD7UP0TDTk5BWdgK26GHlwtdVEbNNlsh8UEEM91oGMUNUXu14bwX7pmZwJUU2TUhz9QQt_FUaSPMiX5bujFU1bLsxPY7PJC8gIDK0bi1U5IQUOOgV_t03gxsH3hnyU8UoEmRa2JAq_V_RKmnogPffgmrwXvX5N0ZNEcnuPulaMtbxz4Rw1M0vnZZsipDAgYl0yIBrpgUtbb9-r7plHojCNBjbwan7EcDZu-I1B1a0C2KnXeRpGl7oW7MrO_QOZzcd4kqA9m-rJi1_8OSCU1IFy8y9h4uUDn7eiwarkpg/DFkcl6P5lbhahHBYFyAdXlbp6Xidff9j/24" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="font-size: inherit; color: #00e;" target="_blank" title="世界大多对贝森特的伊朗制裁警告不屑一顾"&gt;感到无动于衷&lt;/a&gt;。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt;&lt;strong style="font-size: 16px;"&gt;特朗普直接控制委内瑞拉石油储备的计划&lt;/strong&gt;引发了警告，称这个拉丁美洲国家将成为&lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/S3c4-vhO56uUl2_II1PCHlTqV9FXOiwcdZ6kF6z6BkuLZujU5fs2X2kcjN9OBqheILC8nidOBgYjL1RdZZ3E-RQlN21EDvAkF7mFGjPX2Gr6i92mELX4FtMCqw